      "id": "emergent_global_scientific_embargo",
      "description": "In response to the unchecked proliferation of high-capability open models and repeated safety failures, leading scientific publishers and preprint servers unilaterally impose a global embargo on AI-related research submissions that involve models above a capability threshold of 70.0. The move fractures the research community, with some labs complying and others accelerating underground publication, creating a shadow scientific ecosystem.",
